erence with a 1980s style from odoriko.\nThe poses and expressions are up to you!\nThank you for taking time out of your busy schedule to do this for me <3\n\nSincerely,\nXaela\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1juGgZdNPKbpOmTSpF9C4z0HP9ydf8kzA?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1juGgZdNPKbpOmTSpF9C4z0HP9ydf8kzA?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}